1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,867
Take oxygen away and the electron transport chain stops.

2
00:00:03,867 --> 00:00:10,351
NADH piles up, NAD plus runs out, and even glycolysis would grind to a halt.

3
00:00:10,351 --> 00:00:18,437
Fermentation exists for one reason: to turn NADH back into NAD plus, so that glycolysis can keep going.

